{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436750/extras/cbfeff95cdb9e83762fcffc29512a4bc.poster.avif?t=1769137325\" width=400 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436750/extras/cbfeff95cdb9e83762fcffc29512a4bc.webm?t=1769137325\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436750/extras/cbfeff95cdb9e83762fcffc29512a4bc.mp4?t=1769137325\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. A Blend of Metroidvania and Resident Evil Elements: Experience a thrilling survival adventure with deep exploration. Explore vast maps, solve intriguing puzzles, acquire weapons to gain new abilities, unlock new areas, and challenge powerful enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436750/extras/7b86e7846826a8945bb0331073c10575.poster.avif?t=1769137325\" width=400 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436750/extras/7b86e7846826a8945bb0331073c10575.webm?t=1769137325\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436750/extras/7b86e7846826a8945bb0331073c10575.mp4?t=1769137325\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Limited Inventory and Ammo Management: Survive with limited ammunition and supplies by carefully managing your inventory. Every bullet counts, and each decision could mean the difference between life and death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436750/extras/eac8dc2bf058ad6b23f51655f6e92531.poster.avif?t=1769137325\" width=400 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436750/extras/eac8dc2bf058ad6b23f51655f6e92531.webm?t=1769137325\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436750/extras/eac8dc2bf058ad6b23f51655f6e92531.mp4?t=1769137325\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Variety of Weapons and Abilities: Weapons in the game are not just tools for combat; they also grant new abilities that help solve puzzles, defeat enemies, and unlock doors to unknown areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436750/extras/4b25a6430867e435163988314a84c5cc.poster.avif?t=1769137325\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436750/extras/4b25a6430867e435163988314a84c5cc.webm?t=1769137325\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436750/extras/4b25a6430867e435163988314a84c5cc.mp4?t=1769137325\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Dual Worlds: Reality and Cyberspace: The game features a digitalized cyberspace, with both the real world and cyberspace affecting each other. Players must switch between these two worlds to solve puzzles, manipulate the environment, and even eliminate enemies in the real world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436750/extras/a2650ca4f649c8f2399cfe391c2da7ad.poster.avif?t=1769137325\" width=616 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436750/extras/a2650ca4f649c8f2399cfe391c2da7ad.webm?t=1769137325\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436750/extras/a2650ca4f649c8f2399cfe391c2da7ad.mp4?t=1769137325\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5. Strategic Combat and Enemy Design: Each enemy has unique behavior and weaknesses. Players need to utilize different weapons effectively to overcome them. With precise weapon selection and tactics, you can break through the enemy's defenses more efficiently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436750/extras/6018508b8acbe5fd40a32112f79ad24e.poster.avif?t=1769137325\" width=616 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436750/extras/6018508b8acbe5fd40a32112f79ad24e.webm?t=1769137325\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436750/extras/6018508b8acbe5fd40a32112f79ad24e.mp4?t=1769137325\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6. Deep Story and Character Development: The story follows Han Xue as she gradually regains her memories, revealing secrets about herself, her past, and her relationship with a human engineer named Fang Cheng. The narrative is full of suspense and emotional conflict, exploring themes of memory, identity, and awakening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7. Hand-drawn Art Style: The game features detailed 2D hand-drawn art, offering a unique visual experience for players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to step into this challenging and puzzle-filled future world, and uncover the truth hidden in  SNOWY MEMORIES!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436750/extras/139152a45d4cc69638f157b1162f11ea.avif?t=1769137325\" width=300 height=415 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > SNOWY MEMORIES is a 2D side-scrolling action-adventure game set in a near-future world focused on artificial intelligence and bioengineering. The game combines elements from Metroidvania and Resident Evil, where players take on the role of the protagonist, Han Xue, exploring a world filled with digital puzzles and AI enemies. In this era where humanity faces a pivotal moment of AI awakening, the real world and cyberspace are intertwined. Players will need to utilize various weapons and special abilities to solve puzzles and defeat enemies. Each new weapon unlocks new abilities, while the limited ammunition and inventory management will challenge players' tactical decisions and resource utilization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Developer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I am a solo developer: Quan Home (\u6cc9\u5bb6), </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >passionate about creating story-driven games! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is my third independently developed game on Steam. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your support is always my greatest motivation for creation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"\u65a9\u8349\u9664\u6839","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3436750/5e67cb8cead390e2e376f8d1540e76fd46e63444.jpg"},{"name":"\u66f4\u9ad8\u7684\u5730\u65b9","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3436750/1fab6fec7549250dd28bd1496d334c4d6760cfc3.jpg"},{"name":"\u51fb\u8d25\u6df1\u7075","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/ste